// The person: `person.json`, an export in Aseprite's json-array format of
// `person.png`, standing (the tag `stand`) and then the 4 frames of a walk
// (`walk`), each 12 × 20, 100 ms. It was written by hand, as Aseprite 1.3
// writes `aseprite -b person.aseprite --sheet person.png --data person.json
// --format json-array --list-tags`, since the person has no `.aseprite`
// file yet (ADR-0035): its `meta.version` is a placeholder. Each frame is
// trimmed, and the pivot is its feet, (6, 20): the defaults.
{}
